{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261017/photo/bkn-20261017132415458-1017_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261017133249\"/><p>翠屏北邨翠楣樓發生刑事毀壞案。</p><p>觀塘發生刑事毀壞案。今日(17日)早上8時43分，執法部門接獲翠屏北邨翠楣樓一共用廚房職員報案，指發現上址有5個玻璃窗被毀壞，並於大門發現污漬。人員接報到場，經初步調查，在上址一單位拘捕一名姓陳(75歲)男子，涉嫌「刑事毀壞」，並檢獲一個鐵錘。被捕男子現正被扣留調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-17T05:38:58.924400+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":158,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-17T05:24:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-17T05:37:34.288292+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-17T05:37:34.288292+00:00","content_hash":"e676c2c086f9d39aa4b32b07d193e1916fb6a8c2bc2b13b2eedc0d388f4ff802","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}